ATTRIBUTION AND UPSTREAM TERMS

The bundled geography derives from sources with their own attribution
requirements, recorded in docs/licensing-register.md of the GhanaGeo
repository. GeoNames data is CC BY 4.0 and must be attributed to GeoNames.
OpenStreetMap data is ODbL 1.0: attribute OpenStreetMap contributors and
observe the licence's share-alike terms for derived databases. Those upstream
terms apply in addition to this licence and always override it where they
conflict.
